sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Trader / Product Manager
    participant Skill as requirement-analysis Skill
    participant Checker as ambiguity_checker.py
    participant PRD as PRD Design Skill

    User->>Skill: Submit Vague Business Idea
    Skill->>Checker: Audit for Ambiguous Terms
    alt Ambiguous terms detected (e.g. "fast", "scalable")
        Checker-->>Skill: Return Ambiguity Report
        Skill-->>User: REJECT requirement & ask clarifying questions
        User-->>Skill: Provide numerical metrics (< 50us, 100k msg/s)
    end
    Skill->>Skill: Generate BDD Acceptance Criteria (Gherkin)
    Skill->>Skill: Map Traceability Matrix (BG -> FR -> NFR -> BDD)
    Skill-->>User: Present Implementation-Ready SRS Document
    Skill-->>PRD: Direct Handoff Input to PRD Design Skill
